triage: fix_game: The rules are sound and the platform can express them, but the game file mishandles its deck. After the first trick the three played cards (JD, 10D, QD) reappear in the table deck instead of leaving play. When a new hand begins the deck is not refilled with all 20 cards, so the deal draws from an empty list and crashes.
