triage: fix_game: R10 says each seat is offered the bids 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6 in the simultaneous poll. In every failing scenario the tests' rules for bids like 2, 3, 4 or 5 were 'never matched (the game never put that option to this seat)', and all three seats ended up bidding 0. So the game's bid poll does not offer the full range. The tests read the rules correctly, and the failures in R5–R8 all come from this one bid defect, not from the dealer, eldest or deal logic.
